   290→    description: |
   291→      YAML has pitfalls (Norway problem, type coercion).
   292→      These conventions ensure safe, predictable parsing.
   293→    requirements:
   294→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPJ3Z9T0AWQGEJ3GW2WZ
   295→        slugs:
   296→          - yaml-version
   297→        title: YAML 1.2 Required
   298→        type: requirement
   299→        status:
   300→          maturity: draft
   301→          implementation: not_started
   302→        description: |
   303→          Parsers MUST use YAML 1.2 (not 1.1).
   304→          YAML 1.1 has dangerous implicit typing:
   305→          - "NO" -> false
   306→          - "on" -> true
   307→          - "3.14" might become float
   308→
   309→          YAML 1.2 is stricter and safer.
   310→        implements:
   311→          - '@yaml-conventions'
   312→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPJ3MFX4H51TN64GEB6T
   313→        slugs:
   314→          - yaml-quoting
   315→        title: Quote Ambiguous Strings
   316→        type: requirement
   317→        status:
   318→          maturity: draft
   319→          implementation: not_started
   320→        description: |
   321→          Strings that might be misinterpreted MUST be quoted:
   322→          - "NO", "YES", "true", "false", "on", "off"
   323→          - Numbers that should be strings: "3.14", "1.0"
   324→          - Special values: "null", "~"
   325→
   326→          The linter should catch unquoted ambiguous values.
   327→        implements:
   328→          - '@yaml-conventions'
   329→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPJ3M7T6ZNEMTVYBWP96
   330→        slugs:
