   333→        type: requirement
   334→        status:
   335→          maturity: draft
   336→          implementation: not_started
   337→        description: |
   338→          Multiline strings SHOULD use literal block style (|):
   339→
   340→          description: |
   341→            This is a multiline description.
   342→            It preserves newlines.
   343→
   344→          This is cleaner than quoted strings with \n.
